{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15235010","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15235010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1523501001:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 오랜만이야!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9A02A1108C39D954","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 오랜만이야!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 오랜만이야!","variant_male_record_index":"188770","variant_female_record_index":"188771","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1523501001":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 오랜만이야!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，好久不见！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9A02A1108C39D954","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 오랜만이야!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 오랜만이야!","variant_male_record_index":"188770","variant_female_record_index":"188771","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1523501002:1":{"text":"음... 그렇게 티 나?","source_cn":"唔……有那么明显吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6915BE4D27B58B78","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"음... 그렇게 티 나?","female":"음... 그렇게 티 나?","variant_male_record_index":"188772","variant_female_record_index":"188773","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1523501003:1":{"text":"호위들이 좋은 소식을 가져왔어. 드디어 적당한 식물학자를 찾았대!","source_cn":"因为今天护卫传来了好消息——总算找到合适的植物学者了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x02B338053D8079D7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"호위들이 좋은 소식을 가져왔어. 드디어 적당한 식물학자를 찾았대!","female":"호위들이 좋은 소식을 가져왔어. 드디어 적당한 식물학자를 찾았대!","variant_male_record_index":"188774","variant_female_record_index":"188775","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1523501005:1":{"text":"보칼리스에 적당한 학자가 없었거든. 그런데 얼마 전에 히라이에서 야생 작물 개량에 흥미가 있는 학자가 우리를 도와주겠다고 답장을 보내왔어.","source_cn":"呼临城内没有合适的学者，但前几天希莱城给我回信，说有一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E6AC30D34B6C2FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1523501006:1":{"text":"계산해 보면... 지금쯤 보칼리스에 오는 길일 거야. 아마도 며칠 안에 도착할 것 같아!","source_cn":"我算算……这位学者现在应该已经在来呼临城的路上了，用不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4048C0F040DE313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1523501007:1":{"text":"씀바귀 이삭 개량이 끝나면 오울러 문제도 자연스럽게 해결되겠지요.","source_cn":"等到苦苞穗改良工作全部完成，抗议的问题将会迎刃而解。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC372EFC0DEF6DEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1523501008:0":{"text":"보칼리스도 드디어 안정을 되찾겠군요...","source_cn":"呼临终于要迎来长久的稳定了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x732D7B7B95AE8FE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1523501009:1":{"text":"...영주님! 영주님, 성 밖에 긴급 사태가 발생했습니다!","source_cn":"——殿下！报告殿下！城外出现了紧急情况！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FF1FF4469F00E0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1523501010:0":{"text":"당황하지 말고 말해 봐. 무슨 일이야?","source_cn":"不要慌慌张张的。怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB83F4BD0C1BA3B28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1523501011:0":{"text":"오... 오울러 의원님이 병사들을 모아서 <style=\"highlight\">영주님이 자리에서 물러나지 않으면</style> 보칼리스를 무력으로 공격하겠다고 위협하고 있습니다.","source_cn":"是……奥勒留议事官。他在城外聚集士兵，扬言要用武力强攻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D2016F3655A9BE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1523501012:0":{"text":"대장이 근위대를 이끌고 성문으로 갔는데, 상대가 너무 많아서... 오래 버티지 못할 것 같습니다!","source_cn":"队长已经带着卫队到了城门，但对面人数太多，恐怕……恐怕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x478117BCAD38610F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1523501013:0":{"text":"또... 오울러가!","source_cn":"奥勒留……又是他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ECFD7B62CA934E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1523501013":{"text":"또... 오울러가!","source_cn":"奥勒留……又是他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ECFD7B62CA934E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1523501016:0":{"text":"아반드 님, 여기 계십시오. 제가 먼저...","source_cn":"殿下，您先留在此处，我去城外——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B13EE780CBB168","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1523501017:1":{"text":"멈춰라! 이 앞은 영주님의 거처다. 어찌 감히...","source_cn":"不许动！前方是领主殿下的居所，你们怎敢——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26BA3FD17D99B247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1523501018:0":{"text":"...으악!","source_cn":"——啊！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F21CE43F87854B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1523501019:0":{"text":"무능한 영주여, 그 자리를 내놓아라!","source_cn":"懦弱无能的领主，交出领主之位！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8497D59F5DF428F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1523501020:0":{"text":"그렇지 않다면 병사를 동원할 수밖에!","source_cn":"若再不从，我将带兵攻下此处！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70B3E6AF1DC7F702","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1523501021:0":{"text":"당신이 감히...!","source_cn":"你休想——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2551DDD323ED9CFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1523501022:0":{"text":"오울러, 병사를 이끌고 보칼리스를 공격한 것은 중죄입니다!","source_cn":"奥勒留，你带兵攻城，是谋逆重罪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A4152A73F506CF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1523501023:0":{"text":"그동안의 정을 봐서 하는 마지막 경고입니다. 당장 멈추십시오! 그렇다면 영주님을 설득해 목숨만은 살려드리겠습니다!","source_cn":"看在这么多年同僚的情面上，我最后警告你一次，就此收手！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7281A6BEBD537DCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1523501024:1":{"text":"어리석기는! 그 누구도 내가 보칼리스를 구원하는 것을 막을 수 없어!","source_cn":"愚昧！任何人都休想阻止我拯救呼临！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DD5CFE8C73EB0BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1523501025:1":{"text":"구원은 무슨! 당신은 지금 보칼리스를 파멸시키려고 하고 있습니다!","source_cn":"什么拯救！你才是想摧毁呼临！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x927720703C1EE3A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1523501026:1":{"text":"적당한 학자를 찾았으니 이제 곧 씀바귀 이삭의 개량이 끝날 거예요.","source_cn":"我已经找到了合适的学者，只需要一段时间就能完成苦苞穗的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x170023A25A02930C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1523501027:1":{"text":"그렇다면 아쿠보르는 식량으로 보칼리스를 장악할 수 없겠죠. 휴전 협정의 폐해도 사라질 테니 더는 항의하지 않아도 돼요!","source_cn":"食物不会再成为雅库伯尔牵制呼临的手段，停战合约的弊端也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB45A6AE100E64F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1523501028:1":{"text":"아직 되돌릴 수 있을 때 물러나십시오, 오울러.","source_cn":"退兵吧，奥勒留，趁你还有回头的余地！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC065A5088029D0D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1523501029:1":{"text":"물러나? 하하하...","source_cn":"退兵？哈，哈哈哈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB56DD38A94DC607D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1523501030:1":{"text":"비보, 정말 언제까지 그렇게 고지식하게 굴 건지.","source_cn":"比博，你果然永远都是这么顽固古板。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EC46A332176FD60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1523501031:1":{"text":"지금 물러간다고 하더라도 그 뒤는 어떻게 할 건가? 계속해서 어리석은 신하 노릇을 하면서 우스꽝스러운 정책 놀음에 놀아나고, 아직 철도 안 든 아이를 모실 생각인가? 웃기지 말게!","source_cn":"就算我现在退兵，之后又如何？继续和你一起扮演愚蠢的臣子.